# GymApp

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `DEVELOPMENT.md` before making changes.
- MVP phases 0–4 complete on `main`; tests on `test-automation` branch.
- Local dev: G:\vibe-coding\devkit, `pnpm dev`.
- Production deploy: Docker Compose on AWS EC2 — see `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md`.
- Never commit `.env`, `.env.production`, or secrets.
- One phase at a time; match existing NestJS + React patterns.
- Frontend API base is relative `/api` (Nginx proxy in production).
